1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,051
During Prohibition, the American government deliberately poisoned the alcohol people were drinking.

2
00:00:05,471 --> 00:00:11,300
Industrial alcohol was already laced to make it undrinkable, and bootleggers paid chemists to strip it out.

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:15,714
So in 1926 the Treasury ordered the formulas made deadlier.

4
00:00:16,014 --> 00:00:20,868
Methanol up to ten percent, plus benzene, kerosene, mercury salts, formaldehyde.

5
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:25,423
In New York alone the medical examiner counted around seven hundred deaths in a year.

6
00:00:25,723 --> 00:00:28,719
He said it out loud — the government knew, and kept going.

7
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:32,964
The Anti-Saloon League said anyone who drank it was a deliberate suicide.

8
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:38,513
It ran until Prohibition ended in 1933, and the estimates run to ten thousand.

9
00:00:38,993 --> 00:00:40,839
So what are we not being told about right now?
